OL,3,GNEWSABoy nearly crushed by tree downed
OL,4,Aby lightning
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Time just stood still and I genuinely
OL,7,Fthought the worst had happened - I
OL,8,Fremember screaming his name, because I
OL,9,Fhad no idea whether he had been caught
OL,10,Funderneath," Moore added.
